WEBVTT

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:08.250
Even mushrooms are laced with drugs — products like these are creeping onto the market.

00:00:08.300 --> 00:00:14.750
(Teen) I just look at the shapes… they look fun and pretty, so I look.

00:00:18.500 --> 00:00:24.950
Lately there are two kinds, candy and cookies, and the new ones sell a lot.

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:35.850
From the pictures posted in closed online groups, from the outside

00:00:35.900 --> 00:00:40.650
we simply cannot tell whether these products contain drugs.

00:00:40.700 --> 00:00:47.150
Lab tests confirmed that all of them were laced with or contained drugs.

00:00:48.200 --> 00:00:54.650
They are decorated to catch the eye: fruit shapes, bright colors, even rainbows,

00:00:56.600 --> 00:01:01.550
to target their main users: teenagers and young people.

00:01:01.600 --> 00:01:08.050
The harm is the same as other drugs, just under a different disguise to avoid detection.

00:01:10.700 --> 00:01:15.350
Ordinary people find it very hard to recognize that it is a drug.

00:01:15.400 --> 00:01:21.850
Even users don't know the danger, or that it is a drug at all.

00:01:26.700 --> 00:01:33.150
Police say criminals will use any trick to bring drugs into everyday life.

00:01:33.200 --> 00:01:38.850
At a curious age, eager to explore and show off, young people are easily lured

00:01:38.900 --> 00:01:45.350
into using these drugs, often without their parents knowing.
